    "en": "<table class=\"timer ann\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:14%\"><col style=\"width:15%\"><col style=\"width:17%\"><col style=\"width:20%\"><col style=\"width:13%\"><col style=\"width:21%\"></colgroup><tr><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Label</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Adr.</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Code</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Mnemonic</th><th>Jump<br>to</th><th>Explanation</th></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C0</td><td class=\"c\">FF7</td><td class=\"m\">KIN 7</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"7\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C1</td><td class=\"c\">F27</td><td class=\"m\">DISP 2,7</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C2</td><td class=\"c\">FF8</td><td class=\"m\">KIN 8</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C3</td><td class=\"c\">EC6</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ C6</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C4</td><td class=\"c\">F60</td><td class=\"m\">DISP 6,0</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C5</td><td class=\"c\">CC7</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO C7</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C6</td><td class=\"c\">F02</td><td class=\"m\">DISOUT</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">&bdquo;AUMO&ldquo;</td><td class=\"a\">C7</td><td class=\"c\">1FF</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI F,F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"16\">Generation of the random Morse signs</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C8</td><td class=\"c\">71F</td><td class=\"m\">SUBI 1,F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">C9</td><td class=\"c\">ECB</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ CB</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">CA</td><td class=\"c\">CC8</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO C8</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">CB</td><td class=\"c\">4AD</td><td class=\"m\">ADD A,D</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">CC</td><td class=\"c\">87D</td><td class=\"m\">CMP 7,D</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">CD</td><td class=\"c\">DD5</td><td class=\"m\">BRC D5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">CE</td><td class=\"c\">0D2</td><td class=\"m\">MOV D,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">CF</td><td class=\"c\">90E</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 0,E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D0</td><td class=\"c\">ED3</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ D3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D1</td><td class=\"c\">1E1</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI E,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D2</td><td class=\"c\">C2A</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 2A</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D3</td><td class=\"c\">1F1</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI F,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D4</td><td class=\"c\">C2A</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 2A</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D5</td><td class=\"c\">57D</td><td class=\"m\">ADDI 7,D</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D6</td><td class=\"c\">CCC</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO CC</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">&bdquo;&bull;&ldquo;</td><td class=\"a\">D7</td><td class=\"c\">1F4</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI F,4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"12\">Subroutine for &bdquo;&bull;&ldquo;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D8</td><td class=\"c\">FE4</td><td class=\"m\">DOT 4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">D9</td><td class=\"c\">5FF</td><td class=\"m\">ADDI F,F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">DA</td><td class=\"c\">5FF</td><td class=\"m\">ADDI F,F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">DB</td><td class=\"c\">104</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 0,4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">DC</td><td class=\"c\">FE4</td><td class=\"m\">DOT 4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">DD</td><td class=\"c\">FDE</td><td class=\"m\">DIN E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">DE</td><td class=\"c\">EE1</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ E1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">DF</td><td class=\"c\">53A</td><td class=\"m\">ADDI 3,A</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E0</td><td class=\"c\">F07</td><td class=\"m\">RET</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E1</td><td class=\"c\">5CA</td><td class=\"m\">ADDI C,A</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E2</td><td class=\"c\">F07</td><td class=\"m\">RET</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">&bdquo;&mdash;&ldquo;</td><td class=\"a\">E3</td><td class=\"c\">1F4</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI F,4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"10\">Subroutine for &bdquo;&mdash;&ldquo;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E4</td><td class=\"c\">FE4</td><td class=\"m\">DOT 4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E5</td><td class=\"c\">714</td><td class=\"m\">SUBI 1,4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E6</td><td class=\"c\">EE8</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ E8</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E7</td><td class=\"c\">CE5</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO E5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E8</td><td class=\"c\">FE4</td><td class=\"m\">DOT 4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">E9</td><td class=\"c\">FDE</td><td class=\"m\">DIN E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">EA</td><td class=\"c\">EEC</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ EC</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">EB</td><td class=\"c\">F8A</td><td class=\"m\">INV A</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">EC</td><td class=\"c\">F07</td><td class=\"m\">RET</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr></table>"
  },
  "1": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;white-space:nowrap\">Program start as usual with HALT &ndash; NEXT &ndash; 00 &ndash; RUN.</div>"
  },
  "2": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">When key 0 is pressed, a long tone sounds five times. If, for example, key 7 is pressed, the result is twice long and three times short.</p></div>"
  },
  "3": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">If we have not learned the Morse alphabet, we compare with the alphabet table, and with each press of a number key the computer produces the corresponding Morse sign.</p></div>"
  },
  "4": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700\">Morse Code</div>"
  },
  "5": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Of course we can represent not only numbers but all the letters of the alphabet in Morse code. For this, the available keys must be used multiple times. To make this multiple assignment easier for us, among the accessories of the Microtronic computer we find, among other things, a silver keypad mask with the inscription (bottom left) &bdquo;Morse Decoder&ldquo;.</p></div>"
  },
  "6": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Place the keypad mask on the keypad with the smoke-glass-colored cover hood open, and close the hood again. In the top row (second key from the left) we have <b>SOS</b>. When this key is pressed, the computer automatically produces the international distress signal &bdquo;three times short &ndash; three times long &ndash; three times short&ldquo;. The key that was previously used only for the digit 0 is now also responsible for the letters A and B.</p></div>"
  },
  "7": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">If we press this key (in the bottom row on the left), the result is, as before, five times long. If in the top row we press the key labeled <b>BU 1</b> and then the key <b>OAB</b>, the result is &bdquo;short-long&ldquo;, i.e. the Morse sign <b>A</b>. If at the top right the key <b>BU 2</b> and then again the key <b>OAB</b> is pressed, the result is &bdquo;long &ndash; three times short&ldquo;, i.e. the Morse sign <b>B</b>. One quickly gets used to the fact that, for representing the letters, one of the keys <b>BU 1</b> or <b>BU 2</b> is additionally required in each case.</p></div>"
  },
  "8": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Even if we cannot do Morse, after a short time we are able to put together complete &bdquo;radio messages&ldquo;. Many an amateur radio operator might turn pale with envy.</p></div>"
  },
  "9": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">The special function of the key at the top left with &uarr;YZ is explained in the following chapter.</p></div>"
  },
  "10": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">The entire experimental setup and programming remains in place for the following chapter.</p></div>"
  }
}